  <tr> 
    <td height="30" colspan="2"> 
      <div align="justify"> 
        <p><font size="2" face="Arial"><b>“THE MALAYSIAN HIGH COMMISSION” – NEW 
          DELHI</b> HAS RECENTLY NOTIFIED THAT WITH IMMEDIATE EFFECT, INDIAN NATIONALS 
          TRAVELLING TO <b>MALAYSIA</b> COULD AVAIL THE TOURIST <b>“VISA ON ARRIVAL” 
          FOR A STAY UPTO 14 DAYS </b>UNDER THE FOLLOWING CIRCUMSTANCES :-<br>
          </font></p>
      </div>
      <ol>
        <li> 
          <div align="justify"><font face="Arial" size="2"> PAX CAN MAKE AN ENTRY 
            INTO KUALA LUMPUR FROM THIALAND OR SINGAPORE <b>BY AIR</b></font></div>
        </li>
        <li> 
          <div align="justify"><font face="Arial" size="2">PAX TRAVELLING <b>BY 
            SURFACE FROM SINGAPORE</b> SHOULD ENTER ONLY <b>THROUGH THE 2ND LINK 
            OF TANJUNG KUPANG. </b></font></div>
        </li>
      </ol>
      <p align="justify"><font face="Arial" size="2">PAX SHOULD BE IN POSSESSION 
        OF A VALID PASSPORT,A RETURN CONFIRMED AIR TICKET, 2 PASSPORT SIZE PHOTOGRAPHS. 
        <br>
        <br>
        FEE FOR VISA ON ARRIVAL AT AIRPORT : RINGGIT 50/- (APROX INR 650/-)</font></p>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr> 
    <td height="2" colspan="2"><img src="http://www.udaanindia.com/updateimg/back-ground.jpg" width="450" height="1"></td>
  </tr>
  <tr > 
    <td height="2" colspan="2"> 
      <div align="center"><b><font color="#800080" size="4" face="Arial"><u><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt"> 
        UNITED KINGDOM</span></u></font><font size="4"><i></i></font></b></div>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr > 
    <td height="133" colspan="2"> 
      <div align="justify"> 
        <p><font face="Arial" size="2">According to the new regulations all Indian 
          National would be required to obtain a Direct Airside Transit Visa (DATV) 
          for U.K. if they are travelling via U.K.<br>
          <br>
          However if the pax is meeting one of the following criteria he would 
          not require a transit visa :</font></p>
      </div>
      <ul>
        <li> 
          <div align="justify"><font face="Arial" size="2">A valid visa and ticket 
            for Canada or the USA</font></div>
        </li>
        <li><font face="Arial" size="2">For those travelling from Canada or the 
          USA, a visa for that country which if expired did so no more than two 
          calendar days before arrival in the UK</font></li>
        <li><font face="Arial" size="2">A valid USA-1551 Permanent Residence Card 
          (Green Card) issued on or after 21 April , 1998 ;</font></li>
        <li><font face="Arial" size="2">A valid Canadian Permanent Resident Card 
          issued on or after 28 June 2002</font></li>
        <li><font face="Arial" size="2">A valid common format Category D visa 
          for entry to an EEA State which is valid for more than three months;</font></li>
        <li><font face="Arial" size="2">A valid common format residence permit 
          issued by an EEA State pursuant to Council Regulation (EC) No.1 030/2002;</font></li>
        <li><font face="Arial" size="2">A diplomatic or official passport issued 
          by the Indian Government.</font></li>
      </ul>
    </td>
  </tr>
